  * and found nothing. This publishes one (boot-arg sweetbl=1, default off)
  * and logs every setProperties / open / newUserClient. No panel writes.
+ * 0209: named AppleARMBacklight (CoreBrightness treats only that class as the
+ * built-in display). brightness-nits (16.16) is logged; sweetbl=2 also sends
+ * DCS 51 = 4 + nits * 507 / 500 (4..511) through SweetFramebuffer's panel thread.
  */
